					"id": 740240509,
					"content": "太陽是金色的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740240512,
					"content": "能拜託兩位最後一件事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希露艾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740240513,
					"content": "希望兩位能帶一件「黑色」的東西給我。如此一來，我就知道應該用什麼素材來製作出「像太陽一樣璀璨的色彩」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希露艾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740240514,
					"content": "真的要找嗎？我覺得這個東西已經和太陽沒有什麼關係了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740240515,
					"content": "#不過，既然她都這麼要求了…{NICKNAME}，就找一件「黑色的東西」給她看看吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740240510,
					"content": "如果是晚上的太陽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740240511,
					"content": "就算在晚上也不會變成黑色啦！倒不如說，晚上哪來的太陽啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740240506,
					"content": "不愧是派蒙大人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740240507,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}就別跟著起哄啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740240508
					],
